# AGENTS.md — cold-start operating schema

> The AGENTS.md is the document the agent reads on cold-start. It tells the agent **what your system is, what the rules are, and what the agent can and cannot do.** This template is tool-agnostic. Your tool will inject the contents on cwd-only load.

> **Length target:** well under 20,000 characters. If your AGENTS.md is longer, you're putting too much in the schema. Move detail to atomic notes and link.

